---
/** Section 2: a main agent delegating to sub-agents with fresh contexts. */
---

<div class="ctx not-content">
	<div class="subagents">
		<div class="subagents__main"><b>Main agent</b>: keeps the plan and the criteria, delegates the parts</div>
		<div class="subagents__child"><b>Sub-agent A</b><br />find every place that calls the API</div>
		<div class="subagents__child"><b>Sub-agent B</b><br />write the version service</div>
		<div class="subagents__child"><b>Sub-agent C</b><br />write the tests for AC-4</div>
		<div class="subagents__note">Each sub-agent starts with a small, fresh context and returns a short result, not its whole work log.</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div class="stat not-content">
	<span class="stat__num stat__num--ok">Most</span><span class="stat__txt">of what an agent writes without the facts it needs looks fine…</span>
	<span class="stat__num stat__num--bad">Some</span><span class="stat__txt">…is invented, written in exactly the same confident tone as the rest.</span>
	<span class="stat__foot">Reading the output does not tell you which part is which. Only a check against a source, a test or a run does.</span>
</div>
